---
title: Test - View Streaming Response Assertions
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant CP as Chat Panel
    participant Store as Session Store
    participant WS as WebSocket Client
    participant API as Chat API (Server)

    API->>WS: WsReceivePayload (type: chunk, content)
    Note right of WS: assert payload.type == "chunk"
    Note right of WS: assert payload.content is non-empty string

    WS->>CP: onMessage(chunk)
    CP->>Store: appendChunk(messageId, chunk)
    Note right of Store: assert message exists for messageId
    Note right of Store: assert message.content grows by chunk length

    CP->>Dev: Render streaming text
    Note right of CP: assert partial text visible in UI
    Note right of CP: assert message styled as assistant bubble

    Note over API, WS: Repeats for each chunk
    Note right of Store: assert final content == concatenation of all chunks

    API->>WS: WsReceivePayload (type: done, artifactRefs)
    Note right of WS: assert payload.type == "done"

    WS->>CP: onMessage(done)
    CP->>Store: Finalize message, store artifactRefs
    Note right of Store: assert message is marked complete
    Note right of Store: assert artifactRefs stored on message (may be empty)
    Note right of Store: assert each artifactRef has path and label

    CP->>Dev: Render complete message with clickable artifact refs
    Note right of CP: assert artifact refs rendered as clickable elements
    Note right of CP: assert streaming indicator removed

    Dev->>CP: Clicks artifact ref
    CP->>Store: setSelectedArtifact(ref)
    Note right of Store: assert selectedArtifact.path matches clicked ref
    Note right of Store: assert selectedArtifact is not null after click
